{
  "uid": "wcl-d12-build-runtime",
  "title": "Build vs Runtime",
  "description": "D12 (feature 060): which commit and seat moved the runtime numbers. Annotations mark each api version (service.version) while it ran.",
  "tags": [
    "wcl-agent",
    "cross"
  ],
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-7d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timezone": "browser",
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "Running commit",
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(255, 152, 48, 0.9)",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "mimir"
        },
        "expr": "max by (commit, seat, service_version) (cross:running_commit:info)",
        "step": "60s",
        "titleFormat": "{{commit}} ({{seat}})",
        "textFormat": "service.version {{service_version}}",
        "tagKeys": "commit,seat",
        "useValueForTime": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Dashboards",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "wcl-agent"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 7
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Attribution.** A commit belongs to the seat of the latest hand-off on the same feature\n(key `status:<feature>` or `merge:<feature>`) at or before the hand-off or merge entry that names it; a merge with no\nhand-off on its feature belongs to its author. The running version is the api's `service.version`\n(the git short SHA, first 7 characters); a version no board entry names shows as\n*unattributed*. Board facts reach Mimir through `observability/build-runtime/commits.py`\n(run it at wrap-up, or any time).\n\n**Build cost** is an estimate: the sprint's usage rows for that feature and seat (`usage.txt`,\nwritten at wrap-up), priced at the team's default model's list price, booked on the feature's\nlast commit. Empty until the usage file exists, never zero.\n\n**Runtime deltas** compare a commit with the selected range as a whole: its mean while it ran,\nminus the mean of all versions over the same range. Positive = slower, more errors or more\nexpensive than the range's average. A new version's first 5 minutes still include the old\nversion's requests (5-minute rate windows)."
      },
      "id": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "p95 latency by commit",
      "description": "api p95 over all routes but the chat socket and streaming generation, labelled with the commit running (cross:http_latency:p95_by_commit).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "max by (commit, seat) (cross:http_latency:p95_by_commit)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{commit}} {{seat}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "id": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Error ratio by commit",
      "description": "Share of api requests whose span status is error (cross:http_error_ratio:5m_by_commit).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "max by (commit, seat) (cross:http_error_ratio:5m_by_commit)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{commit}} {{seat}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "id": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "LLM cost per request by commit",
      "description": "Runtime LLM spend (genai:cost_usd:rate5m) per api request, chat turns included (cross:llm_cost_per_request:5m_by_commit).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "max by (commit, seat) (cross:llm_cost_per_request:5m_by_commit)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{commit}} {{seat}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "id": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Commit → seat → build cost → runtime deltas",
      "description": "One row per commit that ran in the range. Deltas: the commit's mean minus the range's mean over all versions (see How to read this).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "max by (commit, seat, feature) (avg_over_time(cross:http_latency:p95_by_commit[$__range])) - scalar(avg_over_time(cross:http_latency:p95[$__range]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "max by (commit, seat, feature) (avg_over_time(cross:http_error_ratio:5m_by_commit[$__range])) - scalar(avg_over_time(cross:http_error_ratio:5m[$__range]))",
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "max by (commit, seat, feature) (avg_over_time(cross:llm_cost_per_request:5m_by_commit[$__range])) - scalar(avg_over_time(cross:llm_cost_per_request:5m[$__range]))",
          "refId": "C",
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "mimir"
          },
          "expr": "max by (commit, seat, feature) (last_over_time(build_commit_cost_usd[30d])) and on (commit) max by (commit) (last_over_time(cross:running_commit:info[$__range]))",
          "refId": "D",
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Build cost (est.)"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "currencyUSD"
              },
              {
                "id": "noValue",
                "value": "-"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Δ p95"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "s"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Δ error ratio"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "percentunit"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Δ LLM cost / request"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "currencyUSD"
              },
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 4
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "id": 5,
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "commit": 0,
              "seat": 1,
              "feature": 2,
              "Value #D": 3,
              "Value #A": 4,
              "Value #B": 5,
              "Value #C": 6
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "commit": "Commit",
              "seat": "Seat",
              "feature": "Feature",
              "Value #D": "Build cost (est.)",
              "Value #A": "Δ p95",
              "Value #B": "Δ error ratio",
              "Value #C": "Δ LLM cost / request"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sortBy",
          "options": {
            "sort": [
              {
                "field": "Δ p95",
                "desc": true
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
